WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 19]

01:42.320 --> 01:43.180
See that?

01:43.480 --> 01:44.780
They are inside the cave.

01:44.960 --> 01:45.890
I don't care if you

01:46.110 --> 01:47.810
have to dig. Just bring him to me!

01:48.800 --> 01:49.380
Young Master,

01:49.640 --> 01:50.890
the cave system

01:51.080 --> 01:51.860
is convoluted.

01:52.120 --> 01:53.530
The tunnels are windy.

01:53.760 --> 01:55.000
The bends are sharp.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.690
Straight to the point!

01:57.870 --> 01:59.260
It will be difficult to find them.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.020
It will be easy to find them.

02:01.020 --> 02:02.170
How can I say it's difficult

02:02.350 --> 02:02.850
when I haven't tried?

02:05.160 --> 02:05.780
But Young Master,

02:05.920 --> 02:07.100
you see,

02:08.110 --> 02:09.180
those vermin

02:09.390 --> 02:10.370
are no threat.

02:10.640 --> 02:11.130
Just leave them be.

02:11.350 --> 02:12.620
Vermin?

02:16.390 --> 02:17.410
Zhong Wu,

02:20.750 --> 02:23.090
you finally said something right for once.

02:24.840 --> 02:25.770
Vermin.

02:27.110 --> 02:28.130
We should

02:29.030 --> 02:29.770
treat them

02:30.470 --> 02:32.820
like vermin.

02:33.110 --> 02:33.580
Right?

02:40.920 --> 02:41.410
My friends,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.900
I suppose this is all the demonic sects could do.

02:44.710 --> 02:45.850
They can't do anything

02:46.950 --> 02:48.130
if we hide in this mountain.

02:48.640 --> 02:49.130
That's right.

02:49.400 --> 02:49.850
Unless

02:50.150 --> 02:51.050
they can move the mountain.

02:52.150 --> 02:52.740
Or better yet,

02:53.040 --> 02:54.210
blow the mountain up!

03:04.350 --> 03:05.620
Earthquake Talisman?

03:06.230 --> 03:07.380
Young Master, you can't do that.

03:07.640 --> 03:08.930
If you use the Earthquake Talisman,

03:09.200 --> 03:10.570
this quarry will be all gone.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.900
Your aunt will be angry.

03:15.280 --> 03:15.660
She

03:16.430 --> 03:17.260
will be angry?

03:19.280 --> 03:20.980
More reason for me to blow it up, then.

03:21.560 --> 03:21.980
But,

03:22.150 --> 03:24.100
what about our people in there?

03:24.350 --> 03:25.490
Die!

03:38.950 --> 03:39.410
Quick!

03:39.510 --> 03:40.330
Run inside the cave!

03:40.480 --> 03:41.210
- Go! - Hurry!

03:41.680 --> 03:42.380
- Quick! - Quick!

03:43.200 --> 03:43.620
Hurry up!

04:58.360 --> 04:59.850
Are those people out of their minds?

05:00.240 --> 05:01.940
They used an Earthquake Talisman on their own quarry.

05:02.400 --> 05:03.170
Now that the quarry is destroyed,

05:03.470 --> 05:04.730
no one will know we were ever here.

05:05.000 --> 05:06.540
We just have to survive until the earthquake is over.

05:07.240 --> 05:08.570
You're right.

05:09.150 --> 05:09.940
Once we get out,

05:10.030 --> 05:10.940
I'll buy you a drink.

05:22.910 --> 05:23.380
Lv,

05:24.190 --> 05:24.690
come.

05:26.120 --> 05:26.450
Let's go.

05:34.430 --> 05:35.340
Who's there?

05:36.590 --> 05:37.730
Show yourself now.

05:38.400 --> 05:38.890
Oh, no.

05:39.750 --> 05:40.850
I ran into them again.

05:44.190 --> 05:45.130
It's me, Han Li.

05:45.960 --> 05:47.380
Is this Senior Lv and Xuan?

05:50.360 --> 05:51.260
Yes.

05:51.910 --> 05:52.460
Han.

05:52.830 --> 05:54.100
Come join us.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.850
I have no choice but to meet them.

06:05.190 --> 06:05.780
Seniors,

06:06.360 --> 06:07.050
I'm so glad

06:07.800 --> 06:08.610
you're safe.

06:12.430 --> 06:13.900
I knew you could make it, Han.

06:14.270 --> 06:15.020
What did I tell you?

06:15.510 --> 06:16.140
Han

06:16.240 --> 06:18.140
would surely make it out alive.

06:19.000 --> 06:19.540
Han,

06:20.430 --> 06:21.020
did you

06:21.390 --> 06:22.410
find any other cultivators?

06:23.270 --> 06:23.850
Not at all.

06:24.430 --> 06:25.490
The ground is shaking.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.490
I'm fortunate enough to have escaped.

06:28.070 --> 06:29.020
Luckily, Yellow Maple Valley

06:29.160 --> 06:29.900
has a Soul-Burning Spell.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.370
We can locate and help

06:31.830 --> 06:32.900
each other

06:33.160 --> 06:33.900
in times of need.

06:34.630 --> 06:35.660
My senior, Chen,

06:35.920 --> 06:36.700
is also very powerful.

06:37.270 --> 06:39.020
She has many high-grade artifacts,

06:39.510 --> 06:40.140
and I'm looking for her.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.020
See you.

06:43.070 --> 06:44.220
Hold on.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.810
I've heard of your

06:46.920 --> 06:47.900
Soul-Burning Spell,

06:48.190 --> 06:49.050
but I've never witnessed it.

06:49.870 --> 06:50.850
We are reunited here

06:51.120 --> 06:51.980
by fate.

06:52.360 --> 06:53.900
Why don't you join us?

06:54.630 --> 06:55.140
We can

06:55.360 --> 06:56.140
look after each other.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.370
He's right.

06:58.950 --> 06:59.930
Perhaps we should

07:01.040 --> 07:02.700
find a way out together.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.290
And then,

07:04.560 --> 07:05.930
we can find your senior.

07:06.510 --> 07:07.460
Staying together

07:08.430 --> 07:09.580
makes it safer.

07:09.950 --> 07:10.370
What do you think?

07:11.430 --> 07:11.810
Sure.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.020
Seniors,

07:14.560 --> 07:14.930
you have

07:15.390 --> 07:16.370
my gratitude.

07:18.720 --> 07:19.250
Han.

07:19.720 --> 07:20.290
Come.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.100
Once we leave this place,

07:26.720 --> 07:27.930
they will kill me to silence me.

07:28.830 --> 07:29.700
I need to find a way

07:30.190 --> 07:31.250
to get rid of them first.

07:42.510 --> 07:43.050
It's not him.

07:44.480 --> 07:45.140
There's one over there.

08:04.360 --> 08:04.980
Young Master.

08:05.020 --> 08:05.730
I...

08:07.270 --> 08:08.810
I was just telling him

08:09.430 --> 08:10.170
to look harder,

08:10.680 --> 08:11.850
to think harder

08:11.870 --> 08:12.900
about where he could be.

08:14.160 --> 08:14.700
He's an idiot.

08:16.070 --> 08:17.340
You there. Come here.

08:18.950 --> 08:20.250
Did you see someone from Yellow Maple Valley?

08:20.270 --> 08:21.050
He's this tall.

08:21.160 --> 08:21.980
Wait. He's dead.

08:22.510 --> 08:23.700
He should be this long on the ground.

08:23.950 --> 08:25.290
He's just a plain guy. Did you run into

08:25.310 --> 08:25.980
someone like him?

08:27.070 --> 08:27.610
No?

08:29.040 --> 08:29.610
Bugger off.

08:34.510 --> 08:35.050
Young Master,

08:35.390 --> 08:36.140
this robe

08:36.270 --> 08:37.220
belongs to the Clear Void Sect,

08:37.630 --> 08:38.610
not Yellow Maple Valley.

08:39.750 --> 08:40.250
I know.

08:40.630 --> 08:41.460
I couldn't find our target,

08:41.800 --> 08:42.660
but I came across

08:43.040 --> 08:44.330
a gem vault inside.

08:48.310 --> 08:48.960
Young Master.

08:49.430 --> 08:49.980
Young Master.

08:50.310 --> 08:51.220
I can make you proud.

08:53.190 --> 08:53.660
Young Master,

08:54.600 --> 08:55.730
I know what you're looking for.

08:56.560 --> 08:58.370
You're looking for a dead man by the name of Li.

08:58.390 --> 08:58.930
Did I get it right?

08:59.750 --> 09:00.100
No.

09:02.720 --> 09:03.660
He's not here.

09:04.240 --> 09:04.810
How did you know?

09:05.630 --> 09:06.660
Someone like him

09:08.360 --> 09:09.410
will never die

09:09.510 --> 09:10.780
next to a fool.

09:11.070 --> 09:11.810
You know him very well.

09:12.390 --> 09:13.460
But this is not important.

09:13.600 --> 09:15.050
I have great news.

09:15.750 --> 09:16.580
You see, over there...

09:16.750 --> 09:18.020
You found the place

09:18.600 --> 09:20.020
where the Yan Clan hid their gems.

09:20.390 --> 09:21.170
How did you know?

09:21.600 --> 09:23.460
Knowing my father-in-law,

09:24.390 --> 09:25.980
it would be odd if he didn't have

09:26.390 --> 09:27.490
a hidden gem trove.

09:28.040 --> 09:28.700
How wise of you, Young Master.

09:29.800 --> 09:30.490
It will still do nicely.

09:31.830 --> 09:32.660
Take everything.

09:33.040 --> 09:33.700
Leave nothing behind.

09:34.360 --> 09:35.930
They will be my wife's dowry.

09:37.270 --> 09:39.660
That's what he gets for putting me

09:40.000 --> 09:41.290
on clean up duty.

09:53.680 --> 09:54.930
So he knew it wasn't here.

09:55.510 --> 09:56.810
Yet he blew this place up.

09:57.360 --> 09:58.490
He is heartless.

10:23.550 --> 10:24.460
What's the matter, Han?

10:26.750 --> 10:27.130
Nothing.

10:27.630 --> 10:28.220
I'm just a bit paranoid.

10:28.790 --> 10:29.850
Worry not, Han.

10:30.150 --> 10:31.130
With our protection,

10:31.320 --> 10:32.060
you're safe.

10:32.630 --> 10:32.940
Come.

10:41.910 --> 10:42.300
We should check it out.

10:43.910 --> 10:44.250
Let's go together.

11:04.000 --> 11:04.370
You there.

11:04.750 --> 11:05.220
Scout it out.

11:05.630 --> 11:06.130
Yes.

12:02.910 --> 12:03.460
Luo?

12:04.600 --> 12:05.770
It's Luo from Moonshadow Sect!

12:21.480 --> 12:23.060
This is a dangerous place.

12:30.550 --> 12:32.130
A prowling enemy.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.180
Light up this area.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.700
They are both stronger than I.

12:58.030 --> 12:58.940
I must proceed with care.

13:15.910 --> 13:16.890
What kind of beast is that?

13:17.220 --> 13:20.220
[White Jade Spider, Level 4 Demon Beast]

13:22.630 --> 13:23.700
A level 4 demon beast,

13:23.910 --> 13:24.820
White Jade Spider.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.850
What in the world?

13:52.740 --> 13:54.140
[Summon Icicles]

14:19.510 --> 14:20.890
That beast is huge

14:21.240 --> 14:22.180
yet agile.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.100
It is fast.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.250
We can't run away from it.

14:31.840 --> 14:32.940
Let's fight it together.

14:37.020 --> 14:37.700
[Inferno Talisman]

14:53.480 --> 14:55.060
Use whatever trick you have now.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.010
Stop hiding your strength!

15:11.460 --> 15:12.980
[Terralift]

15:19.780 --> 15:22.300
[Pouch of Infinity, Artifact]

15:28.150 --> 15:28.980
It

15:29.480 --> 15:30.650
can't be this easy.

15:40.550 --> 15:41.250
It mutated?

15:45.630 --> 15:47.130
A Blood Jade Spider?

15:48.030 --> 15:48.610
This is bad.

16:49.660 --> 16:51.140
[Stonehail]

17:09.620 --> 17:10.620
[Sky-Shading Bell, Artifact]

17:26.240 --> 17:27.530
Not bad, Han.

17:28.390 --> 17:29.650
They were trying to kill me as well.

17:32.240 --> 17:32.730
Xuan,

17:33.600 --> 17:34.650
keep that beast trapped.

17:35.080 --> 17:35.820
I'll use my talisman

17:36.320 --> 17:36.820
to kill it.

17:45.790 --> 17:46.850
He hides many things

17:47.440 --> 17:48.490
including precious talismans.

17:48.900 --> 17:50.740
[Empyrean Ruler, Talisman]

18:00.270 --> 18:01.010
So they aren't

18:01.320 --> 18:02.980
exactly loyal to each other either.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.370
They are both hiding something.

18:21.750 --> 18:22.730
Die!

18:24.200 --> 18:24.770
Here it comes.

18:39.750 --> 18:40.420
I should flee first.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.180
One down.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.490
Xuan Yue.

19:33.310 --> 19:34.420
You...

19:45.350 --> 19:47.220
I'll drag you down with me!

20:27.750 --> 20:28.560
Han.

20:29.000 --> 20:29.570
Come out now.

20:30.350 --> 20:31.180
I know where you are.

20:36.640 --> 20:37.420
You didn't intend

20:38.160 --> 20:39.250
to keep the spider trapped.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.140
He ambushed us.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.290
You feigned death.

20:45.510 --> 20:47.220
You can't blame me for pulling

20:48.720 --> 20:49.460
one tiny trick.

20:53.200 --> 20:53.980
Did both of you

20:54.240 --> 20:55.660
rob the gem vault here?

20:57.400 --> 20:58.330
I knew

20:58.960 --> 21:00.250
you were not as simple as you looked.

21:01.310 --> 21:03.180
Unlike that fool who thought he was a genius.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.460
All he could think of

21:04.720 --> 21:05.490
was the gems.

21:07.070 --> 21:08.620
He wanted to kill both of us

21:09.590 --> 21:10.660
so that he could have the gems to himself.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.050
But how could those dirty gems

21:13.400 --> 21:15.290
ever compare to the real treasure

21:17.720 --> 21:19.090
here?

21:22.790 --> 21:23.250
Han,

21:25.350 --> 21:26.140
aren't you curious

21:27.400 --> 21:28.220
about the edge

21:28.510 --> 21:29.050
of the ocean?

21:30.200 --> 21:31.180
Don't you want to know

21:31.920 --> 21:33.090
what lies

21:35.070 --> 21:35.730
beyond the Tiannan Continent?

21:45.200 --> 21:46.980
Someone asked me the same question in the past.

21:50.830 --> 21:51.380
What happened after that?

21:52.720 --> 21:53.490
Did he venture out of the continent?

21:56.270 --> 21:56.730
He died.

22:10.510 --> 22:11.620
And I thought

22:11.880 --> 22:13.940
we were the same people.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.050
Enjoy your moment

22:30.790 --> 22:32.290
with the beast.

22:34.920 --> 22:35.380
Don't worry.

22:35.590 --> 22:36.420
For this brief journey,

22:36.790 --> 22:38.220
I'll bury your body.

22:40.350 --> 22:40.860
Oh, no.

22:47.550 --> 22:48.380
Where did he go?

22:49.000 --> 22:49.900
I need to find him.

23:17.350 --> 23:17.980
Found him.

24:09.460 --> 24:11.100
[Invisible Veil, Artifact]

24:28.000 --> 24:29.530
This is the Cyan Mirror from my sect.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.420
How did you get it?

24:39.260 --> 24:41.460
[Icestorm]

24:54.240 --> 24:54.770
It's futile,

24:54.920 --> 24:55.570
Han.

24:58.860 --> 25:00.060
[White Scale Shield, Artifact]

25:54.350 --> 25:55.250
Using the puppet

25:55.440 --> 25:56.530
to attract the spider.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.330
What a ruse.

26:11.350 --> 26:12.050
My eight-legged friend,

26:12.790 --> 26:13.700
let's talk.

26:20.510 --> 26:21.420
You have a bad temper.

26:39.420 --> 26:40.900
[Oolong Incense, Artifact]

26:45.640 --> 26:46.090
Go.

26:46.310 --> 26:46.810
Keep it in place.

26:59.620 --> 27:02.700
[Cyan Sword Technique]

27:03.350 --> 27:04.220
It's losing color.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.330
It won't last for long.

27:21.660 --> 27:23.460
[Claymore Descent]

27:52.790 --> 27:53.290
Not bad.

27:53.720 --> 27:54.490
This is good.

27:55.440 --> 27:56.570
And I'll take

27:57.110 --> 27:57.980
the gems they stole as well.

28:34.200 --> 28:34.700
These are

28:35.160 --> 28:35.860
spider eggs.

28:40.270 --> 28:40.810
Don't worry.

28:41.400 --> 28:41.900
I'll

28:42.440 --> 28:43.620
take good care of them.

28:49.270 --> 28:50.460
Is this the teleport array

28:51.110 --> 28:52.380
that Xuan Yue mentioned?

29:05.880 --> 29:06.980
Don't you want to know

29:07.510 --> 29:08.570
what lies

29:10.920 --> 29:11.530
beyond the Tiannan Continent?

29:16.070 --> 29:17.050
The world outside?

29:25.350 --> 29:26.220
Could this array

29:26.920 --> 29:28.570
allow one to teleport far away?

29:30.350 --> 29:31.220
Unfortunately, one side is broken.

30:05.030 --> 30:05.770
What are these?

30:07.000 --> 30:07.460
Pills?

30:32.960 --> 30:34.180
Greater Teleport Command Seal?

30:46.070 --> 30:46.770
With this,

30:47.960 --> 30:49.810
I can perhaps repair the array.

31:03.960 --> 31:05.010
All this greed,

31:05.480 --> 31:06.010
scheming,

31:06.400 --> 31:07.140
and ambition.

31:08.200 --> 31:08.860
In the end,

31:09.350 --> 31:10.330
it's all just a pipe dream

31:11.000 --> 31:11.810
that turns to dust.

31:16.400 --> 31:17.220
This teleport array

31:17.550 --> 31:19.220
is a surprising find on this trip.

31:20.550 --> 31:21.420
I don't know

31:21.920 --> 31:23.570
if it will help me or not in the future.

31:24.350 --> 31:25.220
But I have a feeling

31:25.640 --> 31:27.010
that it will serve an important purpose.

31:28.030 --> 31:28.810
For the moment,

31:29.440 --> 31:29.980
no one

31:30.510 --> 31:31.490
can know about it.

31:33.160 --> 31:33.810
I'll mark this place.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.380
Once

31:35.720 --> 31:37.220
I find someone who can fix it,

31:37.880 --> 31:38.810
I'll come back.

32:24.000 --> 32:24.700
You're a lizard,

32:24.960 --> 32:25.660
not a dog.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.220
Act like one.

33:17.030 --> 33:17.980
Han,

33:18.550 --> 33:19.530
is that you?

33:26.000 --> 33:26.660
Senior Chen.

33:35.720 --> 33:36.940
This is a strengthening pill.

33:37.110 --> 33:38.010
Swallow it now.

33:55.920 --> 33:57.660
I should have listened to you.

33:58.750 --> 33:59.770
They would have still been alive.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.090
You're still alive.

34:04.960 --> 34:05.700
I'm glad.

34:13.590 --> 34:14.570
She's my senior.

34:15.480 --> 34:16.620
I can't just

34:16.790 --> 34:17.900
leave her here.

34:58.830 --> 34:59.490
Senior Chen,

34:59.590 --> 35:00.380
you're awake.

35:01.030 --> 35:02.050
Put me down.

35:07.830 --> 35:09.250
Are there any survivors?

35:09.590 --> 35:10.530
I didn't see anyone.

35:13.200 --> 35:14.530
Xuan Yue and Lv Tianmeng

35:14.720 --> 35:16.730
never appear.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.010
They

35:18.400 --> 35:20.290
must have snuck into the gem vault

35:20.750 --> 35:21.620
and looted that place

35:21.880 --> 35:22.700
before running away.

35:23.640 --> 35:24.900
Even if they are alive,

35:25.400 --> 35:26.010
they most probably

35:26.480 --> 35:27.570
won't show their faces.

35:32.680 --> 35:33.700
Her reasoning

35:34.350 --> 35:35.730
saves me an explanation.

35:36.880 --> 35:37.770
No one

35:38.240 --> 35:39.700
knows they are both

35:40.110 --> 35:40.900
dead.

35:51.840 --> 35:52.570
Han.

35:53.360 --> 35:53.820
Rinse yourself.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.940
Is she thinking about what happened in the past?

36:01.320 --> 36:01.900
Han,

36:05.630 --> 36:06.900
I know you don't like me

36:07.630 --> 36:09.010
because of Lu Mingyuan.

36:10.400 --> 36:11.460
But I am the eldest daughter of my family.

36:11.840 --> 36:13.780
I don't have a say in certain matters.

36:14.920 --> 36:16.010
I met a bad person

36:16.710 --> 36:17.340
and...

36:20.000 --> 36:20.530
Anyway,

36:21.070 --> 36:21.780
let's forget it.

36:24.230 --> 36:24.780
Good.

36:26.070 --> 36:27.490
She didn't recall everything.

36:29.070 --> 36:29.900
It happened

36:30.110 --> 36:31.570
a long time ago.

36:32.510 --> 36:34.300
Besides, Lu Mingyuan started it first.

36:35.510 --> 36:36.530
However, killing one of my own

36:37.630 --> 36:38.740
is not exactly a good thing to do.

36:39.880 --> 36:41.490
You've always impressed me.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.460
As a rogue cultivator

36:43.590 --> 36:44.860
with a fake spirit root,

36:45.510 --> 36:46.650
you have mastered many techniques.

36:48.400 --> 36:49.530
You must have trained very hard.

36:52.630 --> 36:53.300
Senior Chen,

36:54.000 --> 36:55.130
why are you talking about this?

36:56.360 --> 36:57.490
I envy you.

36:58.190 --> 36:59.300
I envy your freedom

37:00.000 --> 37:01.740
and your defiant spirit.

37:03.630 --> 37:04.130
I know

37:04.710 --> 37:06.690
that coming from me, this may make you think

37:08.400 --> 37:09.420
that I'm taking

37:09.440 --> 37:10.780
my prestigious background for granted,

37:11.800 --> 37:13.010
or that I'm diminishing your effort.

37:15.000 --> 37:15.530
But...

37:18.400 --> 37:19.380
What am I rambling about?

37:21.030 --> 37:21.900
I hope

37:21.920 --> 37:23.260
you don't find me weird.

37:26.440 --> 37:27.380
Lu Mingyuan

37:27.550 --> 37:28.530
bullied me many times.

37:29.110 --> 37:29.740
You

37:29.880 --> 37:30.780
intervened

37:30.880 --> 37:32.090
many times as well.

37:35.230 --> 37:35.940
I know

37:36.360 --> 37:37.610
you're not like him.

37:39.670 --> 37:40.380
What a relief.

37:40.710 --> 37:42.050
I thought you didn't like me.

37:44.110 --> 37:44.570
Why would I?

37:51.480 --> 37:52.130
So why

37:52.230 --> 37:53.650
do you want to be a cultivator?

37:54.110 --> 37:55.090
Is it because of your family too?

37:59.070 --> 38:00.170
You can say that.

38:01.230 --> 38:02.090
But it's not the only reason.

38:03.510 --> 38:04.570
So what's your reason then?

38:09.190 --> 38:10.900
If I have to pick a reason...

38:14.230 --> 38:15.860
It's probably because of some bread.

38:16.840 --> 38:17.650
Bread?

38:19.190 --> 38:20.130
Flatbread?

38:21.710 --> 38:23.050
Do you like flatbread?

38:28.800 --> 38:29.940
This is my first time

38:30.230 --> 38:32.090
hearing that someone becomes a cultivator for flatbread.

38:37.000 --> 38:38.210
You're intriguing.

38:42.880 --> 38:43.530
Are you injured?

38:45.970 --> 38:46.500
Come.

39:03.550 --> 39:05.340
My brothers are quite naughty.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.740
When they get hurt,

39:07.150 --> 39:08.170
I'll

39:08.280 --> 39:09.380
patch them up.

39:11.920 --> 39:12.570
Do you have a sister?

39:15.480 --> 39:16.050
I have a younger sister.

39:16.670 --> 39:17.740
She loves flatbread more than I do.

39:24.440 --> 39:25.010
Does it still hurt?

39:44.110 --> 39:45.050
I appreciate your help.

39:49.510 --> 39:49.980
Let's go.

40:12.230 --> 40:13.010
I don't see

40:13.320 --> 40:14.610
traces of demonic sects here.

40:15.480 --> 40:16.460
We should be safe.

40:19.360 --> 40:20.130
Just a bit more

40:20.320 --> 40:21.050
and we will enter

40:21.920 --> 40:23.530
the area guarded by the Seven Sects before nightfall.

40:34.960 --> 40:36.530
We don't usually hang out,

40:37.230 --> 40:38.340
but when we meet,

40:38.840 --> 40:40.340
I see the determination in your eyes

40:41.000 --> 40:42.690
as if nothing can sway you.

40:43.670 --> 40:44.300
You

40:44.360 --> 40:45.050
must have

40:45.630 --> 40:47.650
an unwavering will.

40:51.880 --> 40:54.210
I want that too.

40:55.960 --> 40:57.980
But I don't even have the option.

40:59.360 --> 41:00.050
I thought

41:00.320 --> 41:02.460
I could gladly accept whatever my family arranged for me.

41:03.320 --> 41:05.210
But after Lu Mingyuan,

41:07.550 --> 41:08.340
I became afraid.

41:10.710 --> 41:12.010
I'm afraid of not having a choice

41:13.030 --> 41:14.090
and being ordered around.

41:18.630 --> 41:20.130
Was that why you came to the front line?

41:21.400 --> 41:23.340
I don't know if this is the right decision,

41:24.400 --> 41:26.010
but I want to try.

41:31.510 --> 41:32.340
Right decision

41:33.000 --> 41:33.690
or not,

41:34.670 --> 41:35.340
it's not important.

41:37.030 --> 41:37.780
What is important then?

41:40.590 --> 41:41.010
Being

41:42.960 --> 41:43.780
yourself

41:44.960 --> 41:45.690
is very important.

41:47.920 --> 41:48.860
Being myself?

41:49.800 --> 41:50.570
No one

41:51.190 --> 41:52.300
gets to tell you what a right or wrong decision is.

41:53.030 --> 41:54.300
Only you can do that.

42:05.030 --> 42:05.940
I'm hungry.

42:17.000 --> 42:17.780
Han,

42:18.400 --> 42:19.090
do you want some?

42:19.630 --> 42:20.210
Is it edible?

42:25.320 --> 42:25.940
It's delicious.

42:53.400 --> 42:54.110
Han,

42:54.110 --> 42:55.530
you've always been a lucky person.

42:56.190 --> 42:57.760
I owe this escape to your warning.

42:58.880 --> 42:59.610
Anyway,

43:00.000 --> 43:01.340
how did you

43:01.670 --> 43:03.260
escape from the quarry?

43:03.880 --> 43:04.570
I remember

43:04.880 --> 43:06.300
you have some puppet beasts.

43:07.280 --> 43:08.180
Why is she asking so many questions

43:08.190 --> 43:09.090
despite knowing all that?

43:14.360 --> 43:15.130
Perhaps

43:15.320 --> 43:16.530
we can travel together

43:16.920 --> 43:17.940
and serve at the front line.

43:18.630 --> 43:19.260
No way.

43:20.230 --> 43:21.300
Sure.

43:21.710 --> 43:22.570
If you wish.

43:27.190 --> 43:28.170
Also,

43:28.320 --> 43:29.460
your injury hasn't healed completely.

43:30.070 --> 43:30.860
You should take some pills

43:31.110 --> 43:31.690
and rest up.

43:32.710 --> 43:33.460
Sure.

43:47.030 --> 43:47.650
That's too much.

43:48.030 --> 43:48.490
No worries.

43:49.320 --> 43:50.010
I have

43:50.880 --> 43:51.530
a lot of them.

44:07.360 --> 44:08.650
They are extra potent Oblivion Pills.

44:09.840 --> 44:10.340
Forgive me,

44:10.630 --> 44:11.210
Senior Chen.

44:12.880 --> 44:14.130
Please forget everything

44:14.360 --> 44:15.740
that happened in the quarry.

44:16.550 --> 44:17.820
I can't let anyone know about the teleport array

44:18.150 --> 44:19.170
and the gem vault.

44:34.150 --> 44:34.820
All right.

44:35.480 --> 44:36.740
She should be safe now.

44:45.320 --> 44:45.980
I've spent a lot

44:46.400 --> 44:47.170
of power

44:47.320 --> 44:48.050
after those grueling battles.

44:48.920 --> 44:50.260
I need to find a place to recuperate

44:50.480 --> 44:51.130
and reinforce my training

44:51.630 --> 44:53.010
before I head into the war.

44:54.030 --> 44:55.010
Returning to

44:55.670 --> 44:56.740
Yellow Maple Valley right now isn't a great idea.

44:58.070 --> 44:59.010
Golden Drum Plains it is.

45:19.300 --> 45:24.620
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

45:25.860 --> 45:31.260
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

45:31.380 --> 45:34.580
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:34.820 --> 45:37.060
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:37.460 --> 45:40.300
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:40.820 --> 45:44.780
♪Easier just to miss♪

45:45.620 --> 45:51.100
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

45:52.260 --> 45:57.540
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

45:58.140 --> 46:01.180
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

46:01.460 --> 46:03.580
♪Swept away by time♪

46:04.220 --> 46:06.860
♪Eyes once looked far♪

46:07.340 --> 46:11.300
♪Now lost in the shift♪

46:11.780 --> 46:14.620
♪Autumn winds stir♪

46:14.900 --> 46:16.820
♪Smoke curls once more♪

46:17.260 --> 46:19.700
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

46:20.020 --> 46:23.540
♪Returning to my eyes♪

46:24.100 --> 46:27.060
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

46:27.380 --> 46:30.300
♪Time lost its name♪

46:30.700 --> 46:33.540
♪Was it yesterday♪

46:33.940 --> 46:37.500
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:37.860 --> 46:40.700
♪The world has changed♪

46:41.100 --> 46:42.940
♪Beyond recall♪

46:43.500 --> 46:45.220
♪Time will fade♪

46:45.620 --> 46:50.420
♪All the words ever spoken♪

46:51.100 --> 46:53.980
♪Only this longing remains♪

46:54.460 --> 46:59.740
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

47:00.860 --> 47:07.500
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

47:07.980 --> 47:17.700
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
